      "observed": "The drawing shows R1 and R4 as 0 Ω links from the two servo signal paths to NET0024, so both servo signals are joined to the shared serial bus. The annotation instead says to short R13 and R14, but those are shown as 47 kΩ and 2.2 kΩ resistors in other parts of the circuit. The PWM signal paths also pass through R17 and R24 (1 kΩ) before reaching the servo headers.",
